meta {
  name: saveGroup
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveGroup",
    "params": {
      "product_group_type": "ALLOWANCE",
      "product_group_code": "001",
      "product_group_name": "Kabelbinders"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update an allowance, buying, or custom product group

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `product_group_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the group; omit to create a new group |
  | `product_group_type` | string (nullable) | no | Group type: ALLOWANCE, BUYING, or CUSTOM; required when creating |
  | `product_group_code` | string (nullable) | no | Unique code identifying the group within its type; required when creating |
  | `product_group_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the group; required when creating |
  | `product_group_comment` | string (nullable) | no | Optional internal note about the group |

  **Example: Create an allowance group**. product_group_type cannot be changed after creation.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveGroup",
    "params": {
      "product_group_type": "ALLOWANCE",
      "product_group_code": "001",
      "product_group_name": "Kabelbinders"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "product_group_id": 1
  }
  ```
}
